/ Input: 0
/ Test 14: edge case: a loop that runs zero times, so the program prints nothing
        Input
        Store N
Loop,   Load N
        Skipcond 800       / N > 0: run the body
        Jump Done          / N = 0: leave at once, the body never runs
        Output
        Subt One
        Store N
        Jump Loop
Done,   Halt
N,      Dec 0
One,    Dec 1
